        "Returns raw Axiom JSON under data instead of the upstream {datasets} wrapper.",
        "The upstream user-agent is not sent.",
        "Native category is dev-tools (source Data/Developer Tools: Rust CATEGORIES has no data bucket).",
        "Personal-access-token x-axiom-org-id is not expressed; this recipe authenticates API tokens with Authorization Bearer only.",
        "Ingest/query edge hosts (us-east-1.aws.edge.axiom.co, eu-central-1.aws.edge.axiom.co) are not expressed: official management REST is https://api.axiom.co."
